  "changes": [
    "Source mesh, weights and UVs retained; 80-bone world retarget, local-basis bake with captured parent matrices, in-place feet-grounded animation, cyclic tails; 15 sampled poses per second.",
    "New TGA maps converted to PNG at 1024/512; albedo RGB maximum 238 and original cutout alpha retained. Phone/Observer reuse existing parent textures.",
    "One project-created phone prop, 3 weathered barrier sections, shared soft foot contacts. No new lights or physics forces."
